  "reason": "The completed experiments show that RNA-only multiprofile with avgpool and PCA is the strongest setting so far, with both higher accuracy and F1 than single-profile PCA or transformer aggregation. The image modality is still untested, so it is unclear whether images provide independent predictive signal or whether a multimodal model would be justified. config_011 tests an image-only baseline using the same multiprofile/avgpool structure as the best RNA experiment but with ResNet-50, isolating the image representation while holding profile and aggregation fixed. This is the best next experiment because it establishes the needed unimodal baseline for later interpreting multimodal fusion results and avoids confounding image usefulness with fusion before testing more complex multimodal configurations."
}

